  "body": "The current content model of img element is \"Empty\"\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#the-img-element\n\n> Content model:\n> Empty.\n\nHowever, there is no \"Empty\" content model in 3.2.4 Content models.\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#content-models\n\nOther elements such as input element use \"Nothing\".\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#the-input-element\n\n> Content model:\n> Nothing.\n\nThis PR makes the content model of imge element be \"Nothing\".\n\nSigned-off-by: Takeshi Kurosawa taken.spc@gmail.com\n",
